-- Title: PIC12F1840 gpsim regression — device defaults + @config_expect
-- Author: Matthew Schinkel, Copyright (c) 2026 all rights reserved.
--
-- Description:
--    PIC12/14 enhanced: **4K words** flash, **256 bytes** RAM. **`include 12f1840`**,
--    **`pragma target clock`**, **`enable_digital_io()`**, **`@config_expect`** for **`check-config`**.
--
-- Notes:
--    **`pragma target WDT DISABLED`** so **gpsim** long **`step`** runs do not reset on WDT
--    (default **0x3FFF** CONFIG1 enables WDT). **`@config_expect`** matches resulting **`__config`**.
--    Other fuse-related **`pragma target`** lines are **omitted**. **PIC12F1840 only.**

include 12f1840

-- @config_expect begin
-- 0x8007 0x3fe7
-- 0x8008 0x3fff
-- @config_expect end

pragma target WDT DISABLED

pragma target clock 4_000_000

enable_digital_io()
